{"seq":2,"slug":"item-analysis-efa","title":"项目分析与探索性因素分析（EFA）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/psychometrics/scale-construction/item-analysis-efa","wordCount":1621,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"项目分析与探索性因素分析-efa\">项目分析与探索性因素分析（EFA）</h1><p>预试数据回来了，一份 30 道题的草稿摆在面前。哪几道该删？这些题实际上测出了几个东西、而不是设计时假想的几个？这两个问题，一个逐题问、一个整体问，分别由项目分析与探索性因素分析回答。它们是把&quot;一堆题&quot;打磨成&quot;一份有结构的量表&quot;的两道核心工序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从逐题体检到结构发现\">核心概念：从逐题体检到结构发现</h2><p>项目分析与 EFA 在量表开发链路上紧密相邻却分工明确。项目分析站在单题视角，像体检一样逐题给出难度、区分度等指标，淘汰明显的坏题；EFA 站在整体视角，从保留题目的相关结构里&quot;发现&quot;它们背后有几个潜在维度。前者做减法，后者找结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[预试响应矩阵] --&gt; B[项目分析&lt;br/&gt;逐题指标]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[难度 P]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[区分度&lt;br/&gt;题总相关·D值]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[删题后α变化]&#10;  B1 &amp; B2 &amp; B3 --&gt; C{删掉坏题}&#10;  C --&gt; D[EFA&lt;br/&gt;从相关结构找维度]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[因子数判定]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[因子旋转]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[解释命名]&#10;  D --&gt; E[初步因子结构&lt;br/&gt;交CFA独立样本检验]\">flowchart TD\n  A[预试响应矩阵] --&gt; B[项目分析&lt;br/&gt;逐题指标]\n  B --&gt; B1[难度 P]\n  B --&gt; B2[区分度&lt;br/&gt;题总相关·D值]\n  B --&gt; B3[删题后α变化]\n  B1 &amp; B2 &amp; B3 --&gt; C{删掉坏题}\n  C --&gt; D[EFA&lt;br/&gt;从相关结构找维度]\n  D --&gt; D1[因子数判定]\n  D --&gt; D2[因子旋转]\n  D --&gt; D3[解释命名]\n  D --&gt; E[初步因子结构&lt;br/&gt;交CFA独立样本检验]</pre><h2 id=\"项目分析-逐题的硬指标\">项目分析：逐题的硬指标</h2><p>项目分析建立在经典测验理论之上（真分数模型见 <a href=\"../measurement-foundations/reliability-classical-test-theory\">信度理论与经典测验理论</a>），核心是几个可计算的逐题指标。</p>\n<p>下表给出常用指标、含义与决策经验值（经验值随测验目的浮动，不是铁律）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>常见取舍</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>难度 P（能力测验）</td>\n<td>答对人数比例</td>\n<td>题目难易</td>\n<td>0.3–0.7 信息量最大，0/1 应删</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通过率/均值（量表）</td>\n<td>选项均值与分布</td>\n<td>偏度、地板天花板</td>\n<td>过偏题区分力差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>题总相关</td>\n<td>题目与总分的相关</td>\n<td>区分度</td>\n<td>&lt;0.3 考虑删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区分度 D 值</td>\n<td>高分组减低分组通过率</td>\n<td>区分高低能力者</td>\n<td>&gt;0.4 优，&lt;0.2 差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删题后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>去掉该题后的内部一致性</td>\n<td>该题对一致性的贡献</td>\n<td>删后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 升高则该题可疑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个关键提醒：题总相关应使用&quot;校正的题总相关&quot;（corrected item-total correlation），即计算时把该题本身从总分里剔除，否则题目与含自己的总分相关必然虚高。难度也并非越居中越好——筛查极端群体（如选拔尖子或诊断重症）时，有意保留偏难或偏易的题反而合理。指标是工具，服务于测验目的，不可机械套用阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"探索性因素分析-找出背后的维度\">探索性因素分析：找出背后的维度</h2><p>当一批题留下后，EFA 回答&quot;它们背后有几个共同的潜在因子&quot;。其数学内核是把每道观测题表示为若干潜在因子的线性组合加上独特成分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i = \\lambda_{i1} F_1 + \\lambda_{i2} F_2 + \\dots + \\lambda_{im} F_m + \\varepsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是题 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 上的载荷（loading），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是潜在因子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该题的独特方差。EFA 的目标是从题目间的相关矩阵反推出这组载荷与因子数。</p>\n<p>动手前先做适宜性检验：KMO 取样适切性度量（&gt;0.7 较好）与 Bartlett 球形检验（显著才说明相关矩阵不是单位阵、值得做因素分析）。此外要区分两个常被混为一谈的方法——主成分分析（PCA）旨在最大化解释总方差、是纯降维；因子分析（如主轴因子法、最大似然法）旨在解释题目间的共同方差、明确分离出独特误差，更契合&quot;潜在构念&quot;的理论意图。心理测量中应优先用因子分析而非 PCA。</p>\n<h2 id=\"因子数判定与旋转\">因子数判定与旋转</h2><p>&quot;该提取几个因子&quot;是 EFA 最关键也最易出错的决策。传统的特征值大于 1 法则（Kaiser 准则）和肉眼看碎石图（scree plot）都偏主观、易高估因子数。现代方法学强烈推荐平行分析（parallel analysis）：把真实数据的特征值与同维度随机数据的特征值对比，只保留真实特征值高于随机基线的因子，它在模拟研究中表现最稳。实务上应多法并用、结合可解释性综合判断，而非单押一个准则。</p>\n<p>确定因子数后，初始载荷往往杂乱难解释，于是需要旋转（rotation）来逼近&quot;简单结构&quot;——让每道题尽量只在一个因子上高载荷。旋转分两类，下面点明分歧：正交旋转（如 varimax）假设因子间彼此无关；斜交旋转（如 promax、oblimin）允许因子相关。心理构念之间几乎总是相关的（焦虑与抑郁不可能正交），因此现代实践默认优先斜交旋转，只有当因子相关确实趋近零时才退回正交。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解释-命名与交棒\">解释、命名与交棒</h2><p>旋转后看模式矩阵：每个因子由哪些高载荷题构成，就据此命名并解释其心理含义。要警惕两类问题题——交叉载荷题（在多个因子上都中等载荷，结构模糊，常需删除）和孤儿题（在所有因子上都低载荷，未被任何维度捕捉）。命名是质性判断，须回到构念理论而非纯凭统计。</p>\n<p>最后是关键的方法学纪律：EFA 是探索、是生成假设，它在数据里&quot;找&quot;结构，因而极易过拟合当前样本。用同一批数据先 EFA 探索再宣称&quot;结构得到验证&quot;是循环论证。正确做法是把 EFA 得到的因子结构当作待检验的假设，换一个独立样本用验证性因素分析去检验它是否真的成立——这正是 EFA 与 CFA 的根本分工，详见 <a href=\"cfa-and-sem\">验证性因素分析与结构方程模型</a>。本篇产出&quot;候选结构&quot;，下一篇负责&quot;独立验收&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>项目分析逐题做减法（难度、校正题总相关、区分度 D、删题后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>），指标须服务测验目的、不机械套阈值。</li>\n<li>校正题总相关须把本题从总分剔除以免虚高；难度并非越居中越好，取决于测验是常模参照还是极端筛查。</li>\n<li>EFA 把题目表示为潜在因子的线性组合，动手前查 KMO 与 Bartlett；应优先用解释共同方差的因子分析而非纯降维的 PCA。</li>\n<li>因子数判定首选平行分析，Kaiser 准则与碎石图易高估；多法并用结合可解释性。</li>\n<li>心理构念多相关，旋转默认优先斜交（promax/oblimin）而非正交（varimax）。</li>\n<li>EFA 是探索、生成假设，必须用独立样本的 CFA 检验，二者分工是&quot;发现 vs 验证&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"项目分析与探索性因素分析（EFA）","id":"项目分析与探索性因素分析-efa"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从逐题体检到结构发现","id":"核心概念-从逐题体检到结构发现"},{"level":2,"text":"项目分析：逐题的硬指标","id":"项目分析-逐题的硬指标"},{"level":2,"text":"探索性因素分析：找出背后的维度","id":"探索性因素分析-找出背后的维度"},{"level":2,"text":"因子数判定与旋转","id":"因子数判定与旋转"},{"level":2,"text":"解释、命名与交棒","id":"解释-命名与交棒"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"项目编写与量表开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/psychometrics/scale-construction/item-writing-scale-development"},"next":{"title":"验证性因素分析与结构方程模型（CFA/SEM）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/psychometrics/scale-construction/cfa-and-sem"}}